AltoReferralWhitelistAdapter::setBonusDiscount
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when bonus discount is greater than 0.1 ether
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when bonus discount is valid
        ├── when setting normal discount value
        │   ├── it should update bonus discount
        │   └── it should emit BonusDiscountSet event
        ├── when setting zero discount
        │   ├── it should update bonus discount
        │   └── it should emit BonusDiscountSet event
        ├── when setting maximum discount
        │   ├── it should update bonus discount
        │   └── it should emit BonusDiscountSet event
        └── when updating discount multiple times
            ├── it should update bonus discount for each call
            └── it should emit BonusDiscountSet event for each call
